7-Abstract. Let f be a plane curve. We give a procedure based on Abhyankar’s approximate
8:roots to detect if it has a single place at infinity, and if so construct its associated δ-sequence, and
9:consequently its value semigroup. Also for fixed genus (equivalently Frobenius number) we construct
10-all δ-sequences generating numerical semigroups with this given genus. For a δ-sequence we present
11:a procedure to construct all curves having this associated sequence.
12-We also study the embeddings of such curves in the plane. In particular, we prove that polynomial
13-curves might not have a unique embedding.
